            The route is primarily served by Amtrak's Northeast Regional and Carolinian/Piedmont services, offering daily departures between historic Alexandria and Raleigh's central station. Compared to road travel, taking the train helps you avoid I-95 highway traffic and makes city center to city center travel easy without worrying about parking or rental cars.
