                <h2>Tips to Save Money on This Route </h2>
                <p>Managing the cost of train travel from Alexandria to Raleigh is easier with some planning and smart strategies. Prices can vary depending on timing, class, and travel season, but with the right approach, you can save money without compromising comfort. </p>
                <h3>Plan for Better Price Options </h3>
                <p><b>Advance Booking: </b>  Purchasing tickets days or weeks ahead often secures the lowest fares, especially for Coach seating. With only two daily trains, early booking is essential. </p>
                <p><b>Compare Departures: </b>  Check both the Carolinian (1:23 PM) and Floridian (7:09 PM) departure times to find the most economical option. Prices can vary slightly between the two. </p>
