                <p><b>Midweek Travel: </b>  Tuesday and Wednesday departures often have lower fares and better availability than Friday or Sunday trains. </p>
                <p><b>Avoid Peak Travel: </b>  Weekends, holidays, and summer months often lead to higher prices and limited availability on this two-train route. </p>
