                <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                <h3>1. How long is the train from Alexandria to Raleigh? </h3>
                <p>The train journey typically takes 5 hours 30 minutes to 5 hours 56 minutes, depending on the service (Carolinian or Floridian) and any minor delays. </p>

                <h3>2. What is the fastest train from Alexandria to Raleigh? </h3>
                <p>The fastest option is the Carolinian Train 79, which completes the journey in approximately 5 hours and 32 minutes with direct service. </p>

                <h3>3. How much does a train ticket from Alexandria to Raleigh cost? </h3>
                <p>
                    Ticket prices generally fall between:
                    $49$65 for early booking
                    $65$90 for standard fares
                    $90$120+ for last-minute or Business Class travel
                </p>

                <h3>4. Are there direct trains from Alexandria to Raleigh? </h3>
                <p>Yes, both the Carolinian and Floridian are direct trains with no transfers required. </p>

                <h3>5. What amenities are available onboard? </h3>
                <p>Trains offer comfortable seating, Wi-Fi (where available), power outlets, a café car, and luggage space. </p>

                <h3>6. Is train travel faster than driving? </h3>
                <p>Depending on traffic, driving may take 57 hours via I-95, while the train is generally stress-free, predictable, and scenic, often comparable to or faster than driving during peak traffic. </p>

                <h3>7. Can you travel from Alexandria to Raleigh in one day? </h3>
                <p>Yes, the route is suitable for same-day trips, but with only afternoon and evening departures, early morning business may require an overnight stay. </p>

                <h3>8. Which station in Alexandria do trains depart from? </h3>
                <p>Trains depart from Alexandria Union Station at 110 Callahan Drive in Old Town Alexandria. </p>

                <h3>9. Which station do trains arrive at in Raleigh? </h3>
                <p>Trains arrive at Raleigh Union Station, conveniently located at 510 West Martin Street in downtown Raleigh. </p>

                <h3>10. Is Business Class worth it? </h3>
                <p>Yes, Business Class offers extra legroom, a quieter environment, and priority boarding, making it ideal for travelers seeking more comfort during the ~6-hour journey, especially for business travelers or those working onboard. </p>



